        <mxCell id="b4" value="4 · Assert equals&#10;&#10;Actual:   #[payload.citizenId]&#10;Expected: #'RN-12345'" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ede1f5;strokeColor=#9b59b6;fontSize=22;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontColor=#5b2c6f;" vertex="1" parent="1">
